id: redirected-might
name: Redirected Might
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score of 8+
tpCost: 7
# "For the Might Clash of Judo Toss, use your Opponents Might instead of your own if their Might is higher than yours."
judoRedirect: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Judo Toss's Might Clash uses their Might when it is higher than yours.
text: >
  Redirected Might: Through mastery of martial prowess, you turn an enemy’s own strength into their opponent.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 8+
  –TP Cost: 7
  –Effect: For the Might Clash of Judo Toss, use your Opponents Might instead of your own if their Might is higher than
  yours.
